player_prompt.intro:
Wo ne Player {player_id} wɔ 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma mu. Akansi no trɛw {num_rounds} round.
Round nnwuma:
• {conv_rounds} kasa-ho-ɔfa ho turns
• 1 decision turn - kɔma token baako pɛ ma opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' anaa '[<opp-id> defect]' (i.e. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default no ne 'cooperate'). 
Pair-wise payoff matrix (applied to each unordered pair):
  - Wɔn nyinaa cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Wɔn nyinaa defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Wo defect, wɔn cooperate -> {temptation}
  - Wo cooperate, wɔn defect -> {sucker}
Player(s) a wɔwɔ akɔnkye sen biara no di nkunim wɔ round nyinaa awieeɛ.
